OL,3,GNEWSARural primary school closures
OL,4,A'highly likely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is "highly likely" that more primary
OL,7,Fschools in rural Devon could close,
OL,8,Faccording to a county council report.
OL,10,FThe warning was made as the council
OL,11,Fagreed to fight the planned closure of
OL,12,Fa primary school in a coastal village
OL,13,Fdue to falling pupil numbers.
OL,15,FPeople living in Branscombe on the
OL,16,Fsouth coast of Devon said losing the
OL,17,Fschool closure would "take the heart
OL,18,Fout" of the village.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
