OL,3,GNEWSARural primary school closures
OL,4,A'highly likely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are about 20 schools in the
OL,7,Fcounty with fewer than 30 students
OL,8,Fattending that may "need to consider
OL,9,Ftheir future", according to a council
OL,10,Freport which says "at least one other
OL,11,Fschool has started a formal process to
OL,12,Fconsider their future".
